{"slug":"Gateway_to_the_Atlantic","title":"Gateway to the Atlantic","cats":[],"headings":[{"id":"Map_nations","text":"Nations","level":2},{"id":"Map_data","text":"Map data","level":2},{"id":"Countries","text":"Countries","level":2},{"id":"Nations","text":"Nations","level":2},{"id":"Technical","text":"Technical","level":2}],"html":"<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/300px-Gateway_to_the_Atlantic_height_map.webp.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"266\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"554\" data-file-height=\"492\"><figcaption><a href=\"/Height_Map\" title=\"Height Map\">Height map</a></figcaption></figure><p><i>Not to be confused with <a href=\"/Strait_of_Gibraltar\" title=\"Strait of Gibraltar\">Strait of Gibraltar</a></i>\n</p><p>Gateway to the Antlantic is a <a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">map</a> with a canal in the middle (naturally-made). There are two lands, one in the north and one in the south. Europe is on the north side, and Africa on the south side.\n</p>\n\n\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/Gateway_to_the_Atlantic_map.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"568\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"2216\" data-file-height=\"1968\"><figcaption>The Gateway to the Atlantic map, from the <a href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/tree/main/map-generator/assets/maps/gatewaytotheatlantic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenFront game files</a>.</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Map_nations\">Nations</h2></div>\n<p>The map features 27 named <a href=\"/Nations\" title=\"Nations\">nations</a>, including Swiss Confederation, Duchy of Burgundy, Duchy of Aquitaine, County of Provence, Kingdom of Navarre and Kingdom of Valencia.</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Map_data\">Map data</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Categories:</b> Europe</li>\n<li><b>Nations:</b> 27</li>\n<li><b>Public rotation frequency:</b> 5</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Countries\">Countries</h2></div>\n<ul><li>Spain</li>\n<li>France</li>\n<li>Gibraltar</li>\n<li>Morocco</li>\n<li>Algeria</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Nations\"><a href=\"/Nations\" title=\"Nations\">Nations</a></h2></div>\n<p>There are four special <a href=\"/Nations\" title=\"Nations\">nations</a> used on this <a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">map</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Baguettes</li>\n<li>An anti pope</li>\n<li>Wine</li>\n<li>Sardines</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Technical\">Technical</h2></div>\n<p>The size of the <a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">map</a> is 2216 x 1968.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"See_also\">See also</h1></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">Maps</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Strait_of_Gibraltar\" title=\"Strait of Gibraltar\">Strait of Gibraltar</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\" aria-label=\"Jump up\" title=\"Jump up\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/1284581928254701718/1380587510153084958/1380686695518965830\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.com/channels/1284581928254701718/1380587510153084958/1380686695518965830</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>","section":"Maps"}
